1 polymer     nat 'Coagulation factor IX'                  47158.219 2  3.4.21.22 ?     ? ? 
2 polymer     man 'Coagulation factor XIa heavy chain'     41262.098 2  3.4.21.27 ?     ? 
;Activated Recombinant Factor XI Ser557Ala. The molecule is a dimer that is disulphide linked at Cys321. During activation the bond at R369 is cleaved on each subunit to give a two chain molecule. only one monomer is solved here and is composed of a heavy chain and light chain
;
3 polymer     man 'Coagulation factor XIa light chain'     26686.352 2  ?         S557A ? 
;Has a Ser557Ala mutation to render it catalytically dead. The molecule is a dimer that is disulphide linked at Cys321. During activation the bond at R369 is cleaved on each subunit to give a two chain molecule. only one monomer is solved here and is composed of a heavy chain and light chain
;
4 non-polymer syn 'CALCIUM ION'                            40.078    16 ?         ?     ? ? 
5 non-polymer man 2-acetamido-2-deoxy-beta-D-glucopyranose 221.208   8  ?         ?     ? ? 
