1 0 'MULTIPLE SOURCES' COMPLEX 'Complex of Factor XIa (FXIa) with Factor IX (FIX).' 
;FXIa is a dimer and binds 2 FIX molecules. Factor XIa used in this preparation is recombinant FXIa with a Ser557Ala mutation (mature protein numbering). recombinant protein is made as a zymogen that is then activated. The activation involves cleavage after residue Arg369 of FXI to give FXIa
;
? ? 1,2,3 
